{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2021-10-21 13:21:00', 'title': 'EDDI YANG RETURNS TO KETCHUM AS CHIEF CLIENT AND OPERATING OFFICER FOR MAINLAND CHINA', 'text': 'SHANGHAI, OCT. 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEADING GLOBAL COMMUNICATIONS CONSULTANCY KETCHUM \xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF EDDI YANG AS CHIEF CLIENT AND OPERATING OFFICER, CHINA. YANG, A RESPECTED SENIOR LEADER WITH MORE THAN 20 YEARS OF MARKETING AND COMMUNICATIONS EXPERIENCE, REJOINS KETCHUM WITH RESPONSIBILITY FOR BUSINESS GROWTH, CLIENT RELATIONSHIPS AND TALENT DEVELOPMENT.'}